  0.15    2023-10-18
          [BUGFIXES]
           * Avoid creating a long `->then` chain of Futures when handling
             EAGAIN (RT150117)
           * Temporarily enable blocking mode on filehandles when the default
             event loop is not using `select()`, to avoid a CPU spin (RT150117)

